artifact.self_contained_problem:
Let $(R,\mathfrak{m})$ be a regular local ring of dimension $n$, and let $I \subseteq R$ be an ideal whose big height $\mathrm{bight}(I) = e$ (the maximum of the heights of the associated primes of $I$). For a positive integer $m$, let $I^{(m)}$ denote the $m$-th symbolic power of $I$, i.e., $I^{(m)} = \bigcap_{P \in \mathrm{Ass}(R/I)} (I^m R_P \cap R)$. Determine whether each of the following strengthened symbolic-power containments holds for every positive integer $r$:

(1) $I^{(m)} \subseteq \mathfrak{m}^{rn - r} I^{r}$ for all $m \geq rn$;

(2) $I^{(m)} \subseteq \mathfrak{m}^{rn - r - (n-1)} I^{r}$ for all $m \geq rn - (n-1)$;

(3) $I^{(m)} \subseteq \mathfrak{m}^{re - r} I^{r}$ for all $m \geq re$;

(4) $I^{(m)} \subseteq \mathfrak{m}^{re - r - (e-1)} I^{r}$ for all $m \geq re - (e-1)$.

